# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Bowen Deng et al. (2025). Systematic softening in universal machine learning interatomic potentials.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-024-01500-6
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 e133a45fe86c4d20...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 22 (Dataset/benchmark). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: a benchmark of three pretrained universal MLIPs
# (M3GNet 2021.2.8, CHGNet v0.3.0, MACE-MP-0 2023.12.03; Table 1), none of
# them trained here, and two CHGNet fine-tuning experiments on
# Li6Zn2In2(IO3)16 (mp-973966). Only the force MAEs on the mp-973966
# high-energy configurations are expressible as metrics.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-deng2025 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Deng et al. (2025): systematic softening in universal MLIPs (M3GNet, CHGNet, MACE-MP-0)" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-deng2025 .

